<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Fin-help - Asistente Financiero</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,700;1,400&family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-green: #d1d9a1;
            --light-green: #e9edc9;
            --accent-green: #a3b18a;
            --dark-blue: #1d2d50;
            --text-color: #333;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--light-green);
            color: var(--text-color);
        }

        /* ── Hero ── */
        .hero {
            background-color: var(--bg-green);
            padding: 20px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            min-height: 90vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        /* ── Navbar ── */
        nav {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
            border-radius: 50px;
            padding: 12px 40px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-around;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
        }

        nav a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--dark-blue);
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            transition: opacity 0.2s;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            opacity: 0.6;
        }

        /* ── Hero Content ── */
        .hero-content {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-grow: 1;
            padding: 0 10%;
            gap: 40px;
        }

        .hero-text {
            max-width: 450px;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .hero-text h3 {
            font-weight: 300;
            margin: 0 0 4px 0;
            color: var(--dark-blue);
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .hero-text h1 {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 5.5rem;
            font-style: italic;
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--dark-blue);
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .hero-text p {
            font-style: italic;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-top: 16px;
            color: #555;
        }

        .hero-image {
            position: relative;
            width: 50%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }

        /* Círculo decorativo */
        .hero-image::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            width: 420px;
            height: 420px;
            background-color: #e2ebc0;
            border-radius: 50%;
            z-index: 0;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
        }

        .hero-image img {
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 480px;
            z-index: 1;
            position: relative;
            object-fit: contain;
        }

        .btn-session {
            align-self: flex-end;
            margin-right: 5%;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            background-color: rgba(29, 45, 80, 0.08);
            padding: 10px 30px;
            border: 1.5px solid var(--dark-blue);
            border-radius: 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--dark-blue);
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            transition: background-color 0.3s, color 0.3s;
        }

        .btn-session:hover {
            background-color: var(--dark-blue);
            color: white;
        }

        /* ── Quiénes Somos ── */
        .about {
            display: flex;
            padding: 80px 10%;
            gap: 60px;
            align-items: center;
            background-color: var(--light-green);
        }

        .about-img {
            flex: 1;
            background-color: #c4d9f2;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 24px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 320px;
        }

        .about-img img {
            max-width: 100%;
            border-radius: 12px;
            object-fit: contain;
        }

        .about-text {
            flex: 1;
        }

        .about-text h2 {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-style: italic;
            margin: 0 0 20px 0;
            color: var(--dark-blue);
        }

        .about-text p {
            line-height: 1.7;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            color: #444;
        }

        /* ── Galería de imágenes extra ── */
        .gallery {
            padding: 60px 10%;
            background-color: var(--bg-green);
        }

        .gallery h2 {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            font-style: italic;
            color: var(--dark-blue);
            margin: 0 0 40px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .gallery-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 24px;
        }

        .gallery-card {
            background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45);
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px;
            min-height: 260px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
        }

        .gallery-card img {
            max-width: 100%;
            max-height: 260px;
            object-fit: contain;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        /* ── Responsive ── */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero-content {
                flex-direction: column;
                text-align: center;
                padding: 0 5%;
            }
            .hero-image {
                width: 100%;
                margin-top: 30px;
            }
            .hero-image::before {
                width: 300px;
                height: 300px;
            }
            .hero-text h1 {
                font-size: 4rem;
            }
            .btn-session {
                align-self: center;
                margin-right: 0;
            }
            .about {
                flex-direction: column;
                padding: 50px 5%;
            }
            .gallery-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            nav {
                flex-wrap: wrap;
                gap: 10px;
                padding: 12px 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- ── HERO ── -->
    <section class="hero">
        <nav>
            <a href="#">Página Principal</a>
            <a href="#">Biblioteca Virtual</a>
            <a href="#">Alcancía virtual</a>
            <a href="#">Gráficas</a>
        </nav>

        <div class="hero-content">
            <div class="hero-text">
                <h3>Asistente financiero</h3>
                <h1>Fin-help</h1>
                <p>"Organización y formación al alcance de tu mano"</p>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-image">
                <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Construyendo finanzas sólidas">
            </div>
        </div>

        <a href="#" class="btn-session">Registro / Iniciar sesión</a>
    </section>

    <!-- ── QUIÉNES SOMOS ── -->
    <section class="about">
        <div class="about-img">
            <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Organización financiera">
        </div>
        <div class="about-text">
            <h2>¿Quiénes somos?</h2>
            <p>
                Fin-help es una página web diseñada con el propósito de asistir a sus usuarios en la organización de sus finanzas personales a través de diferentes herramientas.
            </p>
            <p>
                Contamos con ayudas como: gráficos de organización, foro de comunidad, alcancía virtual y una biblioteca de información sobre finanzas personales.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── GALERÍA ── -->
    <section class="gallery">
        <h2>¿Qué puedes lograr?</h2>
        <div class="gallery-grid">
            <div class="gallery-card">
                <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Ahorro e inversión">
            </div>
            <div class="gallery-card">
                <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Control financiero digital">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

</body>
</html>
